  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1103.10 Plans Required for Designated Beach or Flow-through Bathing Place Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1103.10 Plans Required for Designated Beach or Flow-through Bathing Place Application. The plans required by Env-Wq 1103.02(c)(3) shall be as follows:\n\n(a) A simple layout to scale or with dimensions shown of the buildings, beach area, toilets, if any, and location of the potable water supply, if any; and\n\n(b) A plan drawn to scale showing the swimming area dimensions including depth.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100) #8468, eff 11-1-05; ss by #10577, eff 5-1-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100); ss by #13198, eff 5-1-21 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100)",
